{
  "sn7.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 7.10 ",
  "sn7.10:0.2": "1. Arahantavagga ",
  "sn7.10:0.3": "Bahudhītarasutta ",
  "sn7.10:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu viharati aññatarasmiṁ vanasaṇḍe. ",
  "sn7.10:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena aññatarassa bhāradvājagottassa brāhmaṇassa catuddasa balībaddā naṭṭhā honti. ",
  "sn7.10:1.3": "Atha kho bhāradvājagotto brāhmaṇo te balībadde gavesanto yena so vanasaṇḍo tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā addasa bhagavantaṁ tasmiṁ vanasaṇḍe nisinnaṁ pallaṅkaṁ ābhujitvā ujuṁ kāyaṁ paṇidhāya parimukhaṁ satiṁ upaṭṭhapetvā. ",
  "sn7.10:1.4": "Disvāna yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike imā gāthāyo abhāsi: ",
  "sn7.10:2.1": "“Na hi nūnimassa samaṇassa, ",
  "sn7.10:2.2": "Balībaddā catuddasa; ",
  "sn7.10:2.3": "Ajjasaṭṭhiṁ na dissanti, ",
  "sn7.10:2.4": "Tenāyaṁ samaṇo sukhī. ",
  "sn7.10:3.1": "Na hi nūnimassa samaṇassa, ",
  "sn7.10:3.2": "Tilākhettasmi pāpakā; ",
  "sn7.10:3.3": "Ekapaṇṇā dupaṇṇā ca, ",
  "sn7.10:3.4": "Tenāyaṁ samaṇo sukhī. ",
  "sn7.10:4.1": "Na hi nūnimassa samaṇassa, ",
  "sn7.10:4.2": "Tucchakoṭṭhasmi mūsikā; ",
  "sn7.10:4.3": "Ussoḷhikāya naccanti, ",
  "sn7.10:4.4": "Tenāyaṁ samaṇo sukhī. ",
  "sn7.10:5.1": "Na hi nūnimassa samaṇassa, ",
  "sn7.10:5.2": "Santhāro sattamāsiko; ",
  "sn7.10:5.3": "Uppāṭakehi sañchanno, ",
  "sn7.10:5.4": "Tenāyaṁ samaṇo sukhī. ",
  "sn7.